;; Card ee045b60: the flee search plans its ends with the go-to planner, so a corridor that runs straight away from the chaser into a dead
;; end is a pocket, and the way out that turns off it is taken. Stone x 0..79, z 0..31, y 0..5 (feet y 3, walls three high, open to the sky);
;; a corridor along z 16 from x 4 to a dead end at x 30, at x 18 a branch north to a field x 12..76, z 0..5 that runs on past where the
;; zombie gives the body up (35 blocks; card 6e5f61f4: a way that ends short of that is a pocket too). The body stands in the corridor
;; at x 12, a zombie (NoAI, helmeted) 6 west of it: straight away is the dead end. Unlit (card 16f510ad: a flight in the dark sees
;; about a cell ahead; the unseen ways are priced, not refused). Should-succeed: the flight starts and the body leaves the corridor
;; for the branch or the field (in the corridor only its mouth at the branch is over 6 from the start and 10 from the dead end).
{:defaults
 {:tags [:hostile :survival :flee]
  :time :any
  :mobs :keep
  :register [{:trigger :hostile-near}]
  :plot {:length 80 :width 32 :height 8}
  :blocks [[:fill [0 0 0] [79 5 31] "stone"]
           [:fill [4 3 16] [30 5 16] "air"]
           [:fill [18 3 6] [18 5 16] "air"]
           [:fill [12 3 0] [76 5 5] "air"]]
  :body {:at [12.5 3 16.5] :yaw 90 :effects [["resistance" 600 4]]}
  :limit-s 60}
 :cases
 [{:name "flight-turns-off-a-dead-end-corridor"
   :act [[:summon "zombie" [6.5 3 16.5] "{NoAI:1b,equipment:{head:{id:\"minecraft:iron_helmet\",count:1}}}"]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :retreat.target} :within-s 25}
            {:no-event {:source :body :kind :died} :for-s 30}]
   :after [[:body-far [12.5 3 16.5] 6] [:body-far [30.5 3 16.5] 10]]}]}
